 "heading": "Istanbul Archaeology Museums",
 "paragraph": "Several of the objects taken from Jerusalem and Samaria while the region was Ottoman are here rather than in Israel, which is why a reader looking for the Siloam inscription or the Gezer calendar finds them in Istanbul.",
