  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Several of the objects taken from Jerusalem and Samaria while the region was Ottoman are here rather than in Israel, which is why a reader looking for the Siloam inscription or the Gezer calendar finds them in Istanbul."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "145 records are held for this collection and 24 are listed here — the ones its own records tie to something biblical, audited first. The rest are in the research corpus, not on this page."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
