   "tag": "p",
   "text": "ARCHAEOLOGY CATALOGUE · ROW BA-049 transcription and dating verification unresolved"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "What it supports. The Gezer Calendar has a scholarly epigraphic publication history and agricultural interpretation."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "What it does not. The accessible record is metadata rather than a checked transcription; language classification and exact date remain debated."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Bears on: Ancient Israel's agricultural setting"
