   "text": "Hezekiah's Tunnel"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "RECORDED HOLDER"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Istanbul Archaeology Museums"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "ARCHAEOLOGY CATALOGUE · ROW BA-041 dated structure; royal attribution interpretive"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "What it supports. Radiocarbon and U-Th measurements support an Iron Age II date for the Siloam Tunnel."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "What it does not. Assigning its construction to Hezekiah combines dating, structure identification and biblical interpretation; the tunnel inscription does not name him."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Bears on: 2 Kings 20:20; 2 Chronicles 32:30"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Matches a row of this project's archaeology catalogue"
  },
  {
