  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "Istanbul Archaeology Museums"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "ARCHAEOLOGY CATALOGUE · ROW BA-075 temple access-rule context"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "What it supports. The museum catalog identifies the ancient Greek Temple Warning inscription and explains its exclusion warning."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "text": "What it does not. BM C.328 is a modern cast; the original is Istanbul 2196T. The text documents a rule rather than an individual Acts episode."
  },
  {
